  Connection health · work
  Workspace API key. No conversation or tool is
  replayed.

› 1. Refresh diagnostics
     Read configuration and health; no inference
     request.
  2. Verify gateway access
     Confirm a minimal inference request; no
     conversation, files or tools.
  3. Credential recovery
     To replace a workspace key, exit and run airs
     --environment NAME login for the environment
     shown above.
  4. Gateway access · Not verified
     A saved credential and health response do not
     verify inference access.
  5. credential service · Needs attention
     Credential service unavailable in this session.
     Check your signed-in user's credential service
     and session bus, then retry.
  6. MCP · service-now
     Not verified · select to reconnect
  7. Manage MCP connections
     Add a gateway server, sign in, reconnect or
     check discovered tools.

